#: ../../source/getting_started/index.md:10
msgid ""
"This document guides you through the complete process of getting started "
"with Telink UniSDK (Unified Software Development Kit)  - from setting up "
"the development environment, obtaining the SDK, and compiling and "
"flashing your first project, to successfully running the first example. "
"This guide is designed for embedded software developers who are new to "
"the UniSDK and have a basic understanding of the C programming language "
"and embedded development fundamentals."
msgstr ""

